  "prompts": {
    "states": "Create EXACT Fasttrack from attached Ben 10 reference as a clean 2D production game sprite sheet. Identity: slim athletic BLUE feline humanoid speedster, two tall pointed ear/head fins, small yellow eyes in black eye markings, blue feline face and cheeks, black fitted torso/shoulders/hips/upper thighs, blue forearms with clawed hands and blue lower legs/three-toed feet, white circular chest badge with black hourglass matching reference. STRICTLY NO TAIL in ANY pose. No stripes, no helmet, no wheels, no additional limbs. Crisp black outlines, flat vivid blue/black TV-cartoon cel art with one shadow tone. Exactly EIGHT fully separate whole-body right-facing/three-quarter poses, 4 columns x 2 rows, generous transparent gutters, all ears/hands/toes fully inside canvas. Row-major: 1 ultimate wind-up low sprinter brace; 2 ultimate active forward speed punch/claw drive; 3 ultimate recover guard; 4 neutral upright relaxed athletic guard; 5 defensive crossed-arm guard; 6 UPRIGHT hit recoil with feet planted; 7 defeated lying sideways as one connected body; 8 low forward sprint dash with rear leg lifted and arms driving. SAME tailless body, ears, face, badge and proportions throughout. Native upright bodies about 350-430px in 1536x1024 or higher. BODY ONLY: no speed streaks, painted motion lines, glows, power balls, ghost copies, ground, shadows, dust, labels or text. True transparent background. Keep at least 25px margin around each FULL silhouette, do not clip extended fists or feet.",
